#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:5
msgid "Quit element editor"
msgstr "退出元件编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:7
msgid ""
"The user can close `QElectroTech element editor`_ at any time. The user does"
" not need to `save`_ the changes on the `element`_ before closing it."
msgstr ""
"用户可以随时关闭 `QElectroTech 元件编辑器 <QElectroTech element editor_>`_ 。在关闭之前，用户无需 "
"`保存 <save_>`_ 对 `元件 <element_>`_ 所做的更改。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:10
msgid ""
"If the current work wants to be saved before closing the `element editor`_, "
"refer to `save`_ section. Even so, QElectroTech display an automatic message"
" to `save`_ the current job if any modification has been created."
msgstr ""
"如果希望在关闭 `元件编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 之前保存当前工作，请参见 `保存 <save_>`_ "
"一节。即便如此，只要有修改，QElectroTech 仍会自动提示 `保存 <save_>`_ 当前工作。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:17
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor save message"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器保存消息"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:21
msgid "Exit QElectroTech element editor from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏退出 QElectroTech 元件编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:23
msgid "Select **File > Quit** menu item to quit QElectroTech element editor."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 退出** 菜单项即可退出 QElectroTech 元件编辑器。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor file menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:31
msgid "Exit QElectroTech element editor using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键退出 QElectroTech 元件编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:33
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:35
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + q`` to quit QElectroTech element editor."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + q`` 退出 QElectroTech 元件编辑器。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/editor_quit.rst:39
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
